\begin{exercise}
\label{prob:2-13}


2-13. Suppose $M$ is a topological space with the property that for every indexed open cover $\mathcal{X}$ of $M$ , there exists a partition of unity subordinate to $\mathcal{X}$ . Show that $M$ is paracompact.
\end{exercise}

